        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "THE WHITE LOTUS",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108615265796",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4ac262f0-2ef8-4205-8c16-37f1c8c12b81).Image",
        "Description": "Following the incident at the Koh Samui establishment, the White Lotus luxury hotel chain has assigned any guests now left without a place to stay to this quaint hotel in Bangkok.\r- However, we have received intelligence that some of the guests transferred over are on our records as instrinsic parts of an international human trafficking operation, who have up till this point continually evaded law enforcement.\rIt is the utmost importance that you deal with these targets, 47. Godspeed to you.",
